# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The local demo workspace's owner password — copy to `.env.demo` and replace CHANGE_ME.
#   cp .env.demo.example .env.demo
# `.env.demo` is gitignored. Read ONLY by `make demo-seed` (backend/bin/demo-seed.php), with Dotenv::parse() into a
# variable, never into the process environment; never printed. At least 12 characters. Alternatively pipe it in:
#   printf '%s' "<password>" | DOCKER_CONTEXT=colima-erp2 make demo-seed SEED_ARGS=--password-stdin
# Standing Rule 10: never paste a real value anywhere.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
DEMO_PASSWORD=CHANGE_ME_DEMO_PASSWORD
